# GitHub Actions (CI)

- Build workflow uses **Java 17** (Corretto), Maven cache, and runs from repo root with explicit `pom.xml`: `mvn -f pom.xml clean compile`, then `mvn -f pom.xml test`, then `mvn -f pom.xml package -DskipTests`.
- Uploaded artifact: `target/habit-tracker-springboot-*.jar` with short retention — keep artifact path in sync with `artifactId` and `version` in `pom.xml` if they change.
- When adding steps (lint, integration tests, coverage), keep JDK matrix aligned with `java.version` in the POM unless intentionally testing multiple versions.
- `workflow_call` outputs are part of the reusable contract for deploy workflows — update callers if you rename jobs or outputs.
